# Read by BuildKit for this Dockerfile only; paths are relative to the build
# context, which is altanalyze3/components. The viewer's import closure is
# cellHarmony, fastCNV, fastComm, rna2*, udon and visualization, so the three
# largest unrelated trees stay out of the image. Without BuildKit the build still
# succeeds; it just carries them.
bam/
snaf/
long_read/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.bak-*
**/*.bak
cellHarmony/webapp/jobs/
cellHarmony/webapp/*.log
visualization/scalable_viewer/*.bak-*
